SUMMARY:Lafayette | Million Meals for MLK Packing Party
LOCATION:Martin Luther King Recreation Center\, 309 Cora Street\, Lafayette
DESCRIPTION:Join volunteers across Louisiana for a Million Meals for MLK Pa
 cking Party and help support our food banks and families across our state.
 \nAbout this Event\nMillion Meals for MLK is a statewide initiative bringi
 ng people and organizations together to help replenish Louisiana’s food 
 banks following the holiday season and strengthen access to food for famil
 ies in need.\nAt each packing party\, volunteers will work side by side to
  prepare and pack food for distribution through Louisiana’s food bank ne
 twork. Every hour of service helps make a difference\, bringing us closer 
 to our shared goal of providing one million meals across the state.\n\nWHA
 T TO EXPECT\nDuring your volunteer shift\, you will:\n* Help pack and orga
 nize food for distribution to communities across Louisiana.\n* Work alongs
 ide fellow volunteers\, community organizations\, and local partners.\n* C
 ontribute to a statewide effort to support Louisiana’s food banks and th
 e families they serve.\n\nWHAT TO WEAR & BRING\nPlease wear comfortable cl
 othing and closed-toe shoes suitable for a volunteer packing environment. 
 All necessary packing supplies will be provided.\nPlease note: Specific in
 structions\, age requirements\, and additional event details may vary by l
 ocation. Be sure to review your event information before arriving.\n\nYOUR
  IMPACT\nOne hour of service helps provide 10 meals.\nBy giving just a lit
 tle of your time\, you're helping make a meaningful difference for familie
 s across Louisiana. Every box packed and every volunteer hour contributed 
 helps strengthen our local food banks and brings us one step closer to our
  goal of one million meals.\n\nWe can't wait to see you!\n\nhttps://happen
 ingnext.com/event/lafayette-million-meals-for-mlk-packing-party-eid1ef0l91
